# THREE MORE HOMES (src/content/interiors/home.gd, BiomeDef.home): a peat
# cutter's in the moss, a salt raker's on the flats, a filer's in the scrapwood,
# who gathers the iron the dead field combs into arcs. Staged by who keeps the
# room.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/homes-three-b.tour --seed=4 --hour=15 --weather=clear:0
#
# 01, 03, 05 are each home from above; 02, 04, 06 over the shoulder at what the
# household lives by.
coast calm
near door:cutter
await door 5
press use 0.1
await inside:home 5
wait 1.0
shot 01-a-peat-cutters-home with room:cutter,land:moss
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 3
near thing:peat_stack
wait 1.0
shot 02-its-peat-stack with room:cutter,shoulder
release shoulder_peek
wait 0.5
near door
wait 0.3
press use 0.1
await outside 5
wait 1.0

near door:raker
await door 5
press use 0.1
await inside:home 5
wait 1.0
shot 03-a-rakers-home with room:raker,land:salt_flats
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 3
near thing:salt_cones
wait 1.0
shot 04-its-salt-cones with room:raker,shoulder
release shoulder_peek
wait 0.5
near door
wait 0.3
press use 0.1
await outside 5
wait 1.0

near door:filer
await door 5
press use 0.1
await inside:home 5
wait 1.0
shot 05-a-filers-home with room:filer,land:scrapwood
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 3
near thing:filings_trays
wait 1.0
shot 06-its-filings-trays with room:filer,shoulder
release shoulder_peek
wait 0.5
near door
wait 0.3
press use 0.1
await outside 5
wait 1.0

